</pre> <p><code>skip</code>, <code>expand</code>, and <code>reify</code> are explicit choices about what Cytoscape shows. <code>skip</code> leaves out the hyperedges, <code>expand</code> replaces each hyperedge with binary edges, and <code>reify</code> adds a node for each hyperedge.</p>
